diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index 34e6c10..2ed81d8 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -12,6 +12,10 @@ This project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.htm
 
 - Add `ByteSlice` and `ByteSliceValue` functions for new `BYTESLICE` attribute type in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/attribute`. (#7948)
 
+### Changed
+
+- `ErrorType` in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/semconv/v1.40.0` now unwraps errors created by `fmt.Errorf` with a single `%w` verb and reports the type of the first underlying error that is not such a wrapper, instead of the unhelpful `*fmt.wrapError`. (#6904)
+
